{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/92aUHuryFRZVyx5f45FBAA?scene=1&click_id=318004524","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:54.280149+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/92aUHuryFRZVyx5f45FBAA?scene=1&click_id=318004524","html":"<div><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/BO6uFynTeNnAR1wcCicFicZNCdDft38l3AVAbtRlkkibPLRImgjsOhGQiaSvb2ic9lzyTkZGpGtFzAugFK2wtPcpdtluAaK0mKL7soqD2Zzl646w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学院介绍</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>哈尔滨工业大学是我国工程经济教育的摇篮。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>1928年</span></strong></em><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><ul><li><p><span>建立商科专业</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span>并入哈尔滨商学院和法政学院</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span>建立商业运输等4个系</span></p></li></ul></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><i><span>  1954年</span></i></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>建立“机器制造企业经济、组织与计划”和“动力企业经济、组织与计划”两个专业。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><b><i><span>1955年</span></i></b></p></section></section><section><p><span>成立“工程经济系”，我国高等工科院校中第一个建立工程经济方面的科系。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>  1984年8月</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>经国家教育部批准，成立“哈尔滨工业大学管理学院”，是我国首批建立的管理学院之一。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><i><span> 2000年6月</span></i></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>原哈尔滨工业大学与原哈尔滨建筑大学合校，两校的管理学院合并，组成新的“哈尔滨工业大学管理学院”。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span> 2008年3月</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>国际经贸关系学院与管理学院合并，组成经济与管理学院。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><b><i><span>2012年</span></i></b></p></section></section><section><p><span>东北地区第一家通过AMBA国际商学院认证的学院。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><b><i><span>2021年</span></i></b></p></section></section><section><p><span>通过AACSB认证。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM5ejqq53hKnJVn3xn3fnp1Zj67UX4tNOTPVFH8vHeGLSwQ5icRUjZSb2T74cZNth2CKbOQV7jxiaGl2bdsXBz1BJ3tIdvCaeBUowuA8ibnaYlkLA/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>滑动查看学院发展历程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM47ibvvonAr7rUtibB0DHzdciaHmsd6dMmibQicDwGiagwQ6GBDskyDprdeTx0sUEsElmyDSlziawlq4MzqFEXppgOZg9sDTBuL2XsdqytodbKJRceRg/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BO6uFynTeNmltia1Su086x3IzyUsqJMbzEKV8TiaxsLjyQLwzvEpdZWjIeZ2aLZ9Ns2ibBD0XZB7G4Ns8cm7YLkNW2Saich8KLcX5N349nk35M8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>在60多年的发展历程中，学院在巩固原有优势的基础上，应对我国及世界变化的复杂环境，积极探索、发现管理领域新兴的研究问题及方向，在推动我国管理理论与实践的发展与创新上做了大量的工作，提出若干新的管理理论、方法与技术，使得若干研究领域或保持或达到国内领先水平，在国际上产生一定影响。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学院采取人才引进、自主培养和人才共享相结合的模式，通过有计划地引进海外人才和国内著名大学优秀博士；支持教师海外进修，提高国际学术交流能力；聘请海外知名学者担任兼职教授和兼职导师，建立首席学术顾问制度和海外学术院长制度，设立创新人才建设项目，培养国际知名的学术带头人，建设起一支结构合理的高水平人才队伍。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/BO6uFynTeNlhYNCbIHVQeeI3eutfM0tDGfMzDz75icczYvspWJZFZeUmoeekBC6TtwRbP0QKKoibwQxZfSibVyQNamcBafoCaZPXS1Knnib1vn4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BO6uFynTeNn0HCz6aX3JlomR9FyibV4ibVKyAQAMJDAWarSkkYfQTd7sgsveThvN3NVPibVm0q0O5zXSiazDdhASpGq33meYmnI4k0OQ4QBO0Ho/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BO6uFynTeNm3o5QZFNfloktn3ic6DUkPMV8QKBicbub5icP1LQhcibSoGRCUkeWSonl3icTbqxDCaGCQT08IAGW0FMatcO3n0Up5TrUIPwEFw2xw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>往期活动照片 ⬆️⬆️⬆️</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（1）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（2）2027年优秀应届本科毕业生，前3学年或前5学期综合成绩排名在本专业前15%，且达到所在院校推荐免试生要求。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（3）学科专业排名前10%的推免生优先考虑。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（4）有志于从事经管类科学研究，并具有较强研究能力的理工科推免生优先考虑。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（5）英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请流程</span></b></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、网上报名：</span></p><p><span>即日起至2026年6月29日，登录网址：https://v.wjx.cn/vm/mh3xKfh.aspx，或扫描下方二维码进行报名。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BO6uFynTeNlz8ceu8lx4ziaauBJEjnozsKxZ6iblIKN5KlcTPCZBafrFysUGfKQLDW8ibk1ibfvt1DiaSgxK89iam5W3VWfI8S34fRiaGVQuGDZ1pg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、提交材料：　</span></p><p><span>（1）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单（或官网截图）；</span></p><p><span>（2）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的本科前3年（或前5学期）的成绩排名证明（模板详见附件1）；</span></p><p><span>（3）体现英语水平的证明材料（国家英语四六级，TOEFL成绩，GRE成绩等）；</span></p><p><span>（4）其他证明材料，包括：已发表论文中代表性论文1篇，应提供全文，其他已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页扫描件；本科期间各类获奖证书扫描件。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>注：请申请人将以上材料扫描后整合为一个PDF文件，邮件主题和文件命名为“本科院校+姓名”，上传至报名链接。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、确定名单：</span></p><p><span>入选学术交流营的名单将于7月3日前通过邮件形式通知，请注意查收。届时未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p><p><span>入选者请准备以下材料进行资格复审：个人有效身份证件,申请材料的1-3（原件），以上材料原件在入营报到时审核。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、报到时间：7月上旬（具体以通知为准）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、报到地点：另行通知</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、活动内容：（1）开营式，介绍学校与学院基本情况；（2）专家学术报告；（3）师生交流会；（4）其他活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他说明</span></b></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、学院将为所有营员提供学术交流营期间在哈尔滨的食宿、参观等费用。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、学员报到后需全程参加学术交流营活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、具体日程将根据实际情况进行调整。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4、具体政策以当年学校相关文件为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5、其它有关信息请关注哈尔滨工业大学经济与管理学院。（http://som.hit.edu.cn/index.htm） 。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/BO6uFynTeNnuKpP14FIF1nEvkQZUaY5SNIiawI0gSO3eaJC6IFKNQGfWUUHViavqHobGTsibgm4jFCFaYMshApP53pYicKOFqfFyiaslfg2ibStR4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：白老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>   联系电话：0451-86414016</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/BO6uFynTeNk9gr03xJh5yGOFxhyb7Nyic7eZudppRdMlwpbPo78PQ0fFYicZe17YAl1drdCfKngJMjtYdJaSm1YQ42PrgJfYGD9SBTuLstBfE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/BO6uFynTeNnetuwwe1tvlQ5f63pmdYp6A7tb5wBjefl7icccL1o9RnQUpvKy8AoP6ATZ4DMok8DVw3iaqdT9jJjHYZ0jekW5yrJAG2VwuVhyU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>扫码下载附件1 ⬆️⬆️⬆️</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BO6uFynTeNnvbXfypz0NkKTQINwvdl5D69lyiaRHq0rxZUFG87NsPJNqqrlzmbgSzASHgupXO7rxkLHNCUHsO2Aibhum9h1epUOFUHaJUPbb8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>来源丨人才培养办公室</span></span></p><p><span><span>排版丨田昊霖</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核丨</span></span><span><span>张旭、徐建慧、于志远</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BO6uFynTeNnLiacL1Hpib6k1iceN5YxDhQF2ic205WGLSPT1xM3wFHVUUQ0LRZKkWGQ5yZMT6LsZfQl23NCezJaMriaBD9T2m0WeicfUNr2u0EUco/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0847039260a62c4deafafa70c6393d6ed401e7071069417eeb6b02a69e941c7e","textLength":1550,"sourceSha256":"415d2e9b2f3ffaa00812b5f3a803aa808d2807eba65e9733957dd42dd7947107","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a875407be72c53d7b0f0","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学经济与管理学院2026年学术交流营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:54.280149+00:00"}
